From: SaaiOS <os@saaios>
Subject: synaptics td4150: since31 drain 0x1b after 0x45, no retry

since30 clocked all 97k (retval=0, status 0x1b) but stayed RomBoot
0x04 with gpio=0. Unread 0x1b held ATTN. switch_mode(BOOTLOADER)
then waited 1s and retried the full image. Bug: retval was already 0.

since31:
- Set romboot_bytes_sent when remaining==0. Never retry 0x45 after
  a full send.
- After 0x45 complete: one drain of leftover ATTN. Log
  0x45 after send drain n= code= mode=.
- If IDENTIFY 0x10 or mode 0x01/0x02: firmware started.
- If still 0x04: RUN_APPLICATION then identify once. Never
  switch_mode BOOTLOADER. Never touch_init as app firmware.
- Keep: stock 24-bit header, SPI CONTINUE, first drain, no lcd_rst,
  no ENABLE_REPORT 0x05, no do_polling, no IRQ printk flood, no IRQ unwind.

Applies after syna-tcm-romboot-stock-continue.patch.

